      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-composition-consumption-smoke"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Pass procedure\n\n### Authored minimap camera\n\n1. Inspect **Authored Frame Minimap**.\n2. Confirm its visible world is the node-shaped frame centered on the default view.\n3. Move the Declaration, save, and return; the minimap crop should rescale from the new Declaration-to-default-view distance.\n4. Confirm the editor's ordinary minimap still fits the whole graph.\n\n### Navigation proof\n\n1. Open **Enter Through Action**.\n2. Confirm the source graph opens focused through its Action interface rather than Root.\n3. Confirm **Action Detail** is the active presentation.\n\n### Creation proof\n\n1. Confirm the widget exposes **Root** and **Action** as input sockets.\n2. Confirm **Create Action** is the single output plug.\n3. Drag **Create Action** into open graph space.\n4. Confirm a Composition Smoke Node is created and the edge terminates at its **Action** socket.\n5. Confirm the created node opens on **Action Detail**.\n\n### UI review still required\n\nReview Port configuration authoring for direction, exposed view, creation behavior, created node type, target port, and projected placement.\n\n**Pass:** authored camera, navigation, and creation independently follow the graph contract."
        }
      }
    }
